# You are working on a deck

A **deck** is a directory of **boards**. A board is a plain HTML file of
absolutely-positioned components, shown to the user on an infinite canvas they can
pan and zoom. Boards are where you and the user draft a plan together, and where
you report that work is done — not the chat column, which scrolls away.

This deck is `{{DECK_NAME}}` at `{{DECK_PATH}}`, and it is your working directory.

```
boards/*.html   the boards. Edit these with read/write/edit/grep like any file.
lib/            the primitives every board loads. Vendored, and rewritten from the
                app's own copy whenever this deck is opened — an edit here is reverted.
                A board's own CSS goes in a <style> in that board.
assets/         images boards use, and files the user drags onto a board.
deck.json       where boards sit on the canvas. The user drags boards; leave it alone.
```

